\pard\cf1\f0\fs32\b0\sb360\sa120\keepn About\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 I am an Information Technology student at York University with interests in web development, interface design, software development, and applied artificial intelligence. I learn best by building, testing, and improving practical projects.\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs32\b0\sb360\sa120\keepn Resume\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 This page provides an embedded copy of my resume and a download button for visitors who would like to review my education, technical skills, and project experience.\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 Button text: Download Resume\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs32\b0\sb360\sa120\keepn Projects\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 The projects on this page include business websites, an interactive brand landing page, a game navigation mod, and an early academic portfolio. Each project reflects a different stage of my technical and design experience.\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs32\b0\sb360\sa120\keepn Blog\par
\pard\cf1\f0\fs22\b0\sb0\sa160\sl253\slmult1 This blog documents how the JavaScript features in this portfolio were built, including the theme switcher, dynamic blog, contact form validation, and project filtering.\par
